Found on k391 (secrets worker). Secrets::_unlock_age_key trusts an existing .ocp/age.key without checking it against the project. A key that does not belong dies at the first SOPS read: 'Could not decrypt data key with any of the provided identities at lib/OCP/Keys.pm line 607.', rendered as an internal error. check_local_age_key exists for this, but only Init.pm calls it. Lane: secrets.
